    "acceptanceRequired": false
  },
  "probeSystem": true,
  "notes": "llvm-mingw UCRT x86_64 ZIP from GitHub; SHA256 is the release asset digest. Builds MinGW (GNU ABI) programs; projects that need MSVC need Visual Studio Build Tools, which OpenMind doesn't install. LLDB is the debugger (GDB is not packaged).",
